<title>FRANCE: SocGen holds 5.1 pct of Havas.</title>
<headline>SocGen holds 5.1 pct of Havas.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Societe Generale holds 5.14 percent of the voting rights in media group Havas, the markets regulator CMF said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that Societe Generale had declared a breach of the five percent threshold after buying shares in a trading operation.</p>
<p>Generale des Eaux, which holds 30 percent of Havas, has said there is no agreement or concerted activity with Societe Generale, in response to a question from the French shareholders' defence group ADAM.</p>
</text>
